flowchart TD
    A[Recipe photos, receipt photos, digital files] --> B[Extract or enter draft data]
    B --> C{Owner review complete?}
    C -- No --> D[Clarify quantities, units, yield or product match]
    D --> C
    C -- Yes --> E[Private bakery records and ingredient ledger]
    F[Opening counts, production, waste and corrections] --> E
    G[Local offers, supplier quotes and price history] --> H[Normalize units, source dates and eligibility]
    E --> I[Calculate ingredient requirements]
    J[Planned batches and overnight prep deadlines] --> I
    I --> K[Budget-aware purchasing optimizer]
    H --> K
    L[Budget, reserve, store limit and storage rules] --> K
    K --> M{Feasible plan?}
    M -- No --> N[Explain shortage or constraint conflict]
    N --> L
    M -- Yes --> O[Shopping schedule and explained trade-offs]
    O --> P[In-store list]
    O --> Q[Online bulk order draft]
    O --> R[Cost, purchasing-power and pricing scenarios]
    P --> S{Owner approves current plan?}
    Q --> S
    S -- Yes --> T[Shop or submit simulated order]
    T --> U[Confirm payment and actual receipt separately]
    U --> E
    S -- Revise --> L
